OL,4,CPM to meet pub bombings families in    
OL,5,Cnew year                               
OL,6,GThe prime minister is to meet the      
OL,7,Gfamilies of people killed in the 1974  
OL,8,GBirmingham pub bombings as they        
OL,9,Gcontinue to call for a public inquiry. 
OL,11,FMP Liam Byrne and Richard Parker, the  
OL,12,FWest Midlands mayor, met Downing       
OL,13,FStreet officials this week to press    
OL,14,Ffor a date for families to put their   
OL,15,Fcase to Andy Burnham.                  
OL,17,FBurnham has now confirmed in a letter  
OL,18,Fto Byrne that he will meet the         
OL,19,Ffamilies in Birmingham early in the    
OL,20,Fnew year.                              
